00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:57.664
COULD SMELL IT ALL.

00:09:57.665 --> 00:09:59.299
THAT WAS A BIG FAIL.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.868
&gt;&gt; Greg: IT HAD TO BE WHEN WE

00:10:00.869 --> 00:10:03.704
KILLED UNCLE FRANK.

00:10:03.705 --> 00:10:05.105
THAT'S THE NAME FOR A PLANT WE

00:10:05.106 --> 00:10:08.108
HAVE IN THE LIVING ROOM.

00:10:08.109 --> 00:10:09.243
I'VE BEEN RAISING BOB ON MY OWN,

00:10:09.244 --> 00:10:11.712
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:10:11.713 --> 00:10:13.614
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I WENT TO THE WRONG

00:10:13.615 --> 00:10:15.516
HOUSE ON THANKSGIVING, I WAS

00:10:15.517 --> 00:10:20.388
CONFUSED.

